---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Custody · where your money actually is | Life Story Wealth Planning';
const description = 'I never hold client money. Your account is at an independent third-party custodian, in your name. I direct how it is invested. I cannot remove funds from it.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/custody">
  <main class="custody-page">
    <section class="cust-hero">
      <p class="cust-eyebrow"><span>Chapter · Custody</span></p>
      <h1 class="cust-h1">Where your money <em>actually is.</em></h1>
      <p class="cust-lede">The single most important structural safeguard in how I've set up the firm, put in a way you can verify. Five questions, straight answers.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cust-qa-column">
      <article class="cust-qa app-reveal">
        <p class="cust-qa-eyebrow">Question 01</p>
        <h2 class="cust-qa-q">Can you take my money?</h2>
        <p class="cust-qa-a">No.</p>
        <div class="cust-qa-body">
          <p>Structurally, no. Your account is in your own name at a third-party custodian. I direct how the money in it is invested. I cannot remove funds from it, to me or to anyone else. That is not a policy I have chosen to follow; it is how the arrangement is set up.</p>
          <p>If you have ever read a story about an adviser who took client money, that story is almost always about an arrangement where the adviser controlled the account and could withdraw from it. That is not how this firm is set up, and under our agreement it cannot be.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="cust-qa app-reveal">
        <p class="cust-qa-eyebrow">Question 02</p>
        <h2 class="cust-qa-q">Where is it, then?</h2>
        <p class="cust-qa-a">At Interactive Brokers LLC.</p>
        <div class="cust-qa-body">
          <p>US-headquartered custodian and broker-dealer, with offices around the world. Suited to actively managed and internationally aware portfolios. Your account there is in your name, not the firm's, not a pooled fund. Statements arrive from them, not from me.</p>
        </div>

        <figure class="cust-map" aria-labelledby="map-cap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 640 220" class="cust-map-svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="map-cap">
            <title id="map-cap">A simple three-party diagram: You own the account, held at Interactive Brokers LLC. I direct how it is invested but cannot remove funds.</title>

            {/* Center node: the custodian */}
            <rect x="220" y="80" width="200" height="80" rx="2" class="cm-node cm-node-cust" />
            <text x="320" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="cm-title">Interactive Brokers LLC</text>
            <text x="320" y="136" text-anchor="middle" class="cm-sub">Third-party custodian</text>

            {/* You node (left) */}
            <rect x="20" y="50" width="150" height="48" rx="2" class="cm-node cm-node-you" />
            <text x="95" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="cm-title-sm">You</text>

            {/* Me node (right) */}
            <rect x="470" y="50" width="150" height="48" rx="2" class="cm-node cm-node-me" />
            <text x="545" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="cm-title-sm">Me</text>

            {/* You -> Custodian arrow */}
            <path d="M 95 100 C 95 130 200 130 240 130" class="cm-arrow cm-arrow-owns" />
            <polygon points="234,127 242,130 234,133" class="cm-arrow-head cm-arrow-owns" />
            <text x="150" y="150" class="cm-arrow-label" text-anchor="middle">Owns the account</text>

            {/* Me -> Custodian arrow (dashed and rubric — restricted) */}
            <path d="M 545 100 C 545 130 440 130 400 130" class="cm-arrow cm-arrow-directs" />
            <polygon points="406,127 398,130 406,133" class="cm-arrow-head cm-arrow-directs" />
            <text x="490" y="150" class="cm-arrow-label cm-arrow-label-brass" text-anchor="middle">Directs investment only</text>

            {/* Bottom no-move-out mark */}
            <line x1="470" y1="180" x2="620" y2="180" class="cm-boundary" />
            <text x="545" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="cm-boundary-label">I cannot remove funds</text>
          </svg>
          <figcaption class="cust-map-caption">
            You own the account. The custodian holds the assets. My role is investment direction. Three parties, one boundary I cannot cross.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </article>

      <article class="cust-qa app-reveal">
        <p class="cust-qa-eyebrow">Question 03</p>
        <h2 class="cust-qa-q">How would I know what's happening?</h2>
        <p class="cust-qa-a">You see it directly.</p>
        <div class="cust-qa-body">
          <p>Every holding, every value, every transaction: at the custodian, in real time. You do not go through me for it. You do not ask me for it. Your custodian login is your custodian login. My role is what to buy and when; visibility is yours.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="cust-qa app-reveal">
        <p class="cust-qa-eyebrow">Question 04</p>
        <h2 class="cust-qa-q">What if something happened to your firm?</h2>
        <p class="cust-qa-a">Your account doesn't.</p>
        <div class="cust-qa-body">
          <p>Your assets sit at the custodian, in your name, separate from Life Story Wealth Planning entirely. If the firm were to close for any reason, your account remains where it is. You would either self-direct going forward or engage a different adviser. The assets themselves do not move because of anything happening to my firm.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="cust-qa app-reveal">
        <p class="cust-qa-eyebrow">Question 05</p>
        <h2 class="cust-qa-q">Why does any of this matter?</h2>
        <p class="cust-qa-a">Because most cautionary tales aren't about markets.</p>
        <div class="cust-qa-body">
          <p>They are about adviser control. Someone had discretion over an account they should not have had discretion over, and it went badly. The structural safeguard removes that failure mode. If I had never intended to act on client money and could never do so structurally, the failure mode does not exist. That is the point.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="cust-verify">
      <p class="cust-verify-eyebrow">Verifying any of this</p>
      <h3 class="cust-verify-h">You do not have to take my word for it.</h3>
      <p class="cust-verify-body">Registration and structure are public record. The Form ADV linked below describes the arrangement, including the custody relationship. If it matters to you to verify anything before we talk, that is where to look.</p>
      <div class="cust-verify-links">
        <a href="https://adviserinfo.sec.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cust-verify-tile">
          <span class="cust-verify-label">Form ADV</span>
          <span class="cust-verify-note">SEC / IAPD registered adviser filing</span>
          <span class="cust-verify-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://brokercheck.finra.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cust-verify-tile">
          <span class="cust-verify-label">FINRA BrokerCheck</span>
          <span class="cust-verify-note">Public record of adviser and broker history</span>
          <span class="cust-verify-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cust-cta">
      <p class="cust-cta-line">The rest of a good conversation about custody is the conversation itself.</p>
      <a class="cta cta-large" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Warm paper background — no more dark vault. Reader-first, question-driven. */
  .custody-page {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) clamp(4rem, 6vw, 8rem);
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
  }

  /* Hero */
  .cust-hero {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.16);
  }
  .cust-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .cust-h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 60;
  }
  .cust-h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--rubric, #8a3324); font-weight: 400; }
  .cust-lede {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.7);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Q+A column */
  .cust-qa-column {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }
  .cust-qa {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(14px);
    transition: opacity 800ms ease, transform 800ms ease;
  }
  .cust-qa.is-in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .cust-qa + .cust-qa { padding-top: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem); border-top: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.12); }

  .cust-qa-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }
  .cust-qa-q {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.6vw, 2.15rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.68);
    margin: 0 0 1.35rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120, 'SOFT' 50;
  }
  .cust-qa-a {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 40;
  }
  .cust-qa-body p {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.88);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .cust-qa-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  /* Three-party map inside Q02 */
  .cust-map {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.5rem clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    background: var(--paper-2, #f4ecdc);
    border: 1px solid rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.15);
  }
  .cust-map-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .cm-node {
    fill: transparent;
    stroke: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    stroke-width: 1.25;
    opacity: 0;
    transform-origin: center;
    transform: scale(0.94);
    transition: opacity 700ms ease, transform 700ms ease;
  }
  .cm-node-cust { stroke-width: 1.75; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-node { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-node-you  { transition-delay: 100ms; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-node-me   { transition-delay: 260ms; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-node-cust { transition-delay: 420ms; }

  .cm-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 700ms;
  }
  .cm-title-sm {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 500ms;
  }
  .cm-sub {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    font-weight: 500;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 800ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-title,
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-title-sm,
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-sub { opacity: 1; }

  .cm-arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    stroke-dasharray: 300;
    stroke-dashoffset: 300;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 900ms;
  }
  .cm-arrow-directs {
    stroke: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
    stroke-linecap: butt;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 1100ms;
    /* re-declare so the dashed pattern below wins */
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-arrow { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  .cm-arrow-head {
    fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    stroke: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 400ms ease 1900ms;
  }
  .cm-arrow-head.cm-arrow-directs { fill: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a); }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-arrow-head { opacity: 1; }

  .cm-arrow-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 1800ms;
  }
  .cm-arrow-label-brass { fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a) 65%, var(--ink, #1c1712) 35%); }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-arrow-label { opacity: 1; }

  .cm-boundary {
    stroke: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.35);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 3 3;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 2100ms;
  }
  .cm-boundary-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-style: italic;
    fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 2100ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-boundary,
  .app-reveal.is-in .cm-boundary-label { opacity: 1; }

  .cust-map-caption {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.62);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  /* Verify strip */
  .cust-verify {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: clamp(4rem, 6vw, 6rem) auto 0;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.16);
  }
  .cust-verify-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .cust-verify-h {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120;
  }
  .cust-verify-body {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.78);
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .cust-verify-links {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .cust-verify-tile {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    column-gap: 1.5rem;
    row-gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.35rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.16);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    transition: border-color 220ms ease, background-color 220ms ease;
  }
  .cust-verify-tile:hover,
  .cust-verify-tile:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    background: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.04);
  }
  .cust-verify-label {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
  }
  .cust-verify-note {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.58);
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
  }
  .cust-verify-arrow {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / -1;
    align-self: center;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    transition: transform 220ms ease;
  }
  .cust-verify-tile:hover .cust-verify-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }

  /* CTA */
  .cust-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cust-cta-line {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.4rem);
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cust-qa, .cm-node, .cm-arrow, .cm-arrow-head, .cm-arrow-label, .cm-title, .cm-title-sm, .cm-sub, .cm-boundary, .cm-boundary-label {
      opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
